- if @notification.contribution.present?
  - resource = @notification.contribution
- else
  - resource = @notification.match

|Dear #{resource.user.display_name}!
br
br
|This email confirms your #{resource.class.model_name.human} to the project #{link_to(resource.project.name, project_url(resource.project))}. Your credit card payment has been successfully processed.
br
br
|#{resource.class.model_name.human} amount:
strong #{number_to_currency resource.value, unit: (resource.project.currency || "EUR"), precision: 2}
br
|#{resource.class.model_name.human} date:
strong #{l resource.created_at.to_date, format: :long}
br
br
- if resource.payment_id.present?
  |Payment reference:
  strong #{resource.payment_id}
  br
br
- if resource.is_a?(Contribution)
  - if resource.project.flexible?
    |You will be notified of the project's funding progress.
  - else
    |If the project reaches its goal, your contribution will be charged. Otherwise, you will be fully refunded.
  br
br
|If you wish to contact #{resource.project.user.name}, send an email to #{mail_to resource.project.user.email}.
br
br
|For any other questions, write to us at #{mail_to Configuration[:email_contact]} or visit our #{link_to('FAQ', "#{Configuration[:base_url]}/faq")}.
br
br
|Thank you for your support!
br
br
|Best regards,
br
|The #{Configuration[:company_name]} Team
